# CREDITS — A House Made of Rain

A 10-second Chinese Ink Wash film, made entirely in code.

## Picture
Procedural rice paper, tapered bristled strokes, blurred ink washes and dry
rain marks (`film.js`). No image or video sources.

## Type
Cormorant Garamond Italic — SIL Open Font License 1.1
(`fonts/OFL-Cormorant.txt`).

## Sound
Original guqin notes, rain air, steps and seal, built from numpy and the
library's physical models (`core/audio/pluck.py`, `core/audio/sfx.py`).
No samples.
